WEBVTT

00:00:00.300 --> 00:00:03.700
Taking the photos

00:00:04.200 --> 00:00:10.800
1. Set up the camera app (or Open Camera) and pair the remote with the phone.

00:00:11.200 --> 00:00:17.800
2. Place the phone on the table's edge and switch the lamp on, cold light, at about 2/3 of full power.

00:00:18.200 --> 00:00:24.800
3. Prepare the book and put it on the photographing stool.

00:00:25.200 --> 00:00:31.800
4. Start the burst with 10 seconds between frames. With experience you can go down to 5 seconds.

00:00:32.200 --> 00:00:38.800
5. After each frame turn the page carefully and wait for the next frame.

00:00:39.200 --> 00:00:45.800
6. At the end stop the camera from the remote.

00:00:46.200 --> 00:00:52.800
7. Transfer the pictures to the computer and remove the failed frames.

00:00:53.200 --> 00:01:00.000
Why a remote: so you never touch the phone by accident and make it fall. The emergency stop is also done from the remote.
